Al Nafi Cloud Machine: This lab runs entirely on a single Linux-based cloud machine provided by Al Nafi. Simply click Start Lab to access your dedicated environment. The machine comes as bare metal with no pre-installed tools, so you will install all required components during the lab exercises.

